VO (**ElevenLabs** Ben Orbit Narrator) → picture (**Google Flow Veo UI / Ultra** via `orbit_flow_veo_ui.py` / template `_generate_veo_from_beats.py`, silent) → edit → `templates/PRODUCTION_CHECKLIST_V2.md` → YouTube package upload.

